OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #303m bypass dropped by
OL,4,Agovernment
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a #303m town bypass are in
OL,7,Fjeopardy after a Government review.
OL,9,FRoads minister Justin Madders said - in
OL,10,Fa letter to MP Brian Mathew - that
OL,11,Fplans for the A350 Melksham Bypass in
OL,12,FWiltshire have been dropped following a
OL,13,Freview of the Major Road Network and
OL,14,FLarge Local Majors programme.
OL,16,FMelksham South councillor Jon Hubbard
OL,17,Ftold BBC Radio Wiltshire he was
OL,18,F"horrified" by the decision.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
