OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #303m bypass dropped by
OL,4,Agovernment
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his letter, Madders said the
OL,7,FGovernment had inherited "a long list
OL,8,Fof unfunded, unaffordable schemes" and
OL,9,Fwanted a more realistic programme which
OL,10,Fcouncils and ministers could afford.
